{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1066046/block/singleImage/3279818/df/01M8D4FWEF86R1ZDR37DXREX04.jpg?updatedAt=1795741196\"/><figcaption>車Cam直擊，屯門私家車轉彎失控剷上草叢，險撞入輕鐵路軌。(Threads/edward_yipky)</figcaption></figure><p>屯門良景輕鐵站附近發生交通意外。昨日(26日)晚上，網上流傳一段車Cam片段顯示，一輛白色私家車在屯門良景輕鐵站附近駛入右彎時突然失控，剷上行人路旁草叢，險撞入輕鐵路軌。樓主在社交平台表示：「啱啱經過見到，嚇到我個心離一離。架車應該要報銷。」警方表示，26日晚上8時27分接獲涉事私家車司機報案，指駕車期間失控撞入草叢，事件中無人受傷。</p><p>在 Threads 查看</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T01:43:51.786849+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":233,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T00:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T21:17:33.354121+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T01:37:15.580673+00:00","content_hash":"bfacce570d8fa6a3889171def2c2fd958b70096e4bef006b914b8c1dc5a6434b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T01:43:51.786849+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}